  ## Nitrous Public Beta & N2O

  Nitrous is now in public beta! Along with our public beta announcement, we're introducing the new power source for your boxes: *N2O*.

  N2O is Nitrous currency that you can use to create more powerful boxes with higher memory and storage.

  You can read more about N2O and see pricing information here:

  [Nitrous Public Beta Announcement](http://blog.nitrous.io/2013/06/26/nitrous-io-is-now-in-public-beta.html)

  [http://help.nitrous.io/N2O](http://help.nitrous.io/N2O)

  ### Confirming your email address

  As part of some changes to the platform, we are making it mandatory for users to confirm their email address. Participants in the private beta will be able to login but you will prompted to confirm your email address.

  Please do so to get access to all of the new Nitrous features.

  ### Thank You!

  As a token of our appreciation for testing out the platform and providing feedback, we'll be giving you *100 free units of N2O*.

  These N2O units never expire, so sign in and upgrade your box today!

  If you have any questions or feedback, please don't hesitate to get in touch at [support@nitrous.io](mailto:support@nitrous.io)

  As always, follow us on Twitter: [@nitrousio](http://twitter.com/nitrousio) for updates and news.

  The Nitrous Team
